#~ msgid ""
#~ "The <command>python3 x.py</command> commands may output a warning message "
#~ "complaining <computeroutput>no codegen-backends config matched the requested"
#~ " path to build a codegen backend</computeroutput>.  And the provided "
#~ "<quote>suggestion</quote> (<computeroutput>add backend to codegen-backends "
#~ "in config.toml</computeroutput>) will not silence it.  This warning is "
#~ "<ulink url='https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/110692'>bogus</ulink> "
#~ "and it should be ignored."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Os comandos <command>python3 x.py</command> podem gerar uma mensagem de "
#~ "aviso reclamando <computeroutput>nenhuma configuração de codegen-backends "
#~ "correspondeu ao caminho solicitado para construir uma estrutura de "
#~ "retaguarda de codegen</computeroutput>. E a <quote>sugestão</quote> "
#~ "fornecida (<computeroutput>adicionar estrutura de retaguarda a codegen-"
#~ "backends em config.toml</computeroutput>) não irá silenciá-la. Esse aviso é "
#~ "<ulink url='https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/110692'>falso</ulink> e"
#~ " deveria ser ignorado."

