#~ msgid ""
#~ "The building system attempts to install some files twice, and during the "
#~ "second attempt it renames the old one (installed in the first attempt) with "
#~ "the <filename class='extension'>.old</filename> suffix.  As the &root; user,"
#~ " remove these files:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "O sistema de construção tenta instalar alguns arquivos duas vezes e, durante"
#~ " a segunda tentativa, renomeia o antigo (instalado na primeira tentativa) "
#~ "com o sufixo <filename class='extension'>.old</filename>. Como o(a) "
#~ "usuário(a) &root;, remova esses arquivos:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput>find /opt/rustc-&rust-version; -name \"*.old\" "
#~ "-delete</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput>find /opt/rustc-&rust-version; -name \"*.old\" "
#~ "-delete</userinput>"

